      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: در بارداری منع مصرف دارد.",
        "en": "Label: contraindicated in pregnancy."
      },
      "quote": "Itraconazole should not be administered for the treatment of onychomycosis to pregnant patients or to women contemplating pregnancy.",
